## Integration Framework

### Integration Principles

1. Begin planning before close
2. Move quickly on day one decisions
3. Retain key talent through incentives
4. Maintain customer focus
5. Capture synergies systematically

### Synergy Categories

| Category | Typical Range | Timeline |
|----------|---------------|----------|
| Revenue Synergies | 5-15% of target | Years 2-3 |
| COGS Savings | 3-8% of target COGS | Year 1-2 |
| SG&A Reduction | 10-20% of target SG&A | Year 1 |
| Tax Optimization | Variable | Year 1 |

### Integration Team

| Role | Responsibility |
|------|----------------|
| Integration Leader | Overall execution |
| Workstream Leads | Functional integration |
| Synergy Tracker | Value capture |
| Communications | Stakeholder management |
| HR Lead | Talent retention |

